source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A heading reads Effect Delimiters exactly as a paragraph does, so Jira renders the asterisks literally; jiro reads a heading whose content is plain text.
-- input.jira --
h1. *a*b*
-- rendered.html --
<h1><a name="ab"></a>*a*b*</h1>
-- want.md --
# \*a\*b\*
-- warnings.json --
[]
